    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30587" root="عمل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَّالٌ</span></b>  One <i>who does much work</i> or <i>labour</i> or
<i>service:</i> or <i>who strives, labours,</i> or <i>toils, in work;</i>
or <i>holds on,</i> or <i>continues, in work.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَّالَةٌ</span>,
applied to a she-camel: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمِلٌ</span>.

